WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:05.350
Lab 1 needs PowerShell 7 with Pester, in
the kit's folder, and no subscription.

2
00:00:05.350 --> 00:00:08.617
Contoso's vault zone is
central and linked to the hub;

3
00:00:08.617 --> 00:00:13.175
the payroll team created its own blob
zone in its workload subscription.

4
00:00:13.175 --> 00:00:17.450
Step 1 runs the check: one of
three vaults has the full posture.

5
00:00:17.450 --> 00:00:19.625
Step 2 reads each vault.

6
00:00:19.625 --> 00:00:21.375
The payroll vault has everything.

7
00:00:21.375 --> 00:00:26.375
The hub certificates vault has no private
endpoint, and its public access is on.

8
00:00:26.375 --> 00:00:32.050
And the portal vault misses every part:
access policies, no purge protection,

9
00:00:32.050 --> 00:00:36.530
an open firewall, public access,
no endpoint and no audit log.
